  data: {
    LLM: '1. **Ante**: All players post an ante. 2. **Initial Deal**: Each player receives 3 hole cards. 3. **First Betting Round**: Players bet based on their hole cards only. 4. **First Community Card**: Dealer reveals the first community card face-up. This is NOT automatically wild. 5. **Second Betting Round**: Players bet. 6. **Second Community Card**: Revealed. 7. **Third Betting Round**: Players bet. 8. **Third Community Card**: Revealed. 9. **Fourth Betting Round**: Players bet. 10. **Fourth Community Card**: Revealed. 11. **Final Betting Round**: Players bet. 12. **Showdown**: Remaining players reveal hands.',
    Player: '1. **Ante**: All players post an ante. 2. **Initial Deal**: Each player receives 3 hole cards. 3. **First Betting Round**: Players bet based on their hole cards only. 4. **First Community Card**: Dealer reveals the first community card face-up. This is NOT automatically wild. 5. **Second Betting Round**: Players bet. 6. **Second Community Card**: Revealed. 7. **Third Betting Round**: Players bet. 8. **Third Community Card**: Revealed. 9. **Fourth Betting Round**: Players bet. 10. **Fourth Community Card**: Revealed. 11. **Final Betting Round**: Players bet. 12. **Showdown**: Remaining players reveal hands.',
    objective: 'Form the best five-card poker hand using any combination of your three hole cards and the four community cards.',
